  "bio": "Ricardo Morais is a master of the black and gray realism style, with a professional portfolio that speaks to nearly two decades of experience in the tattooing field. Stationed in Vila Nova de Gaia, Portugal, at the well-known @ohmytattoo studio, Ricardo maintains an impeccable standard of cleanliness, ensuring each client's experience is not only artistically enriching but also hygienic and safe. His dedication to maintaining a sterile work environment is apparent, making him a trusted choice for those seeking top-tier tattoo artistry.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Vila Nova De Gaia, Portugal\n\n🔴𝕿𝖆𝖙𝖙𝖔𝖔𝖎𝖓𝖌 𝖘𝖎𝖓𝖈𝖊 𝟐𝟎𝟎𝟒\n🔴𝐑𝐞𝐚𝐥𝐢𝐬𝐦 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐁𝐥𝐚𝐜𝐤 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐆𝐫𝐞𝐲\n🔴Estudio Privado \n🔴N.V.Gaia/Braga/Luxemburg\n🔴Inf. DM",
